  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "You should be able to load worlds before entering a portal. This would be very useful for streamers so they could have instant loading times.\nA better idea is to have the portal open up to the world to allow seamless travel between both worlds. only one portal can be loaded like this at a time, and the servers would have to be rewritten to allow instant travel.",
